    "directions": [
      "In a mortar pestle, add garlic, ginger, green chili and make a coarse paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a lagan or handi, add oil, once it's hot, add mutton bones and sautÃ© it on high flame for 8-10 minutes or until golden brown in color.",
      "Add mutton mince, prepared ginger garlic paste, salt to taste, coriander powder, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, tender coriander stems, onions and mix it well.",
      "Cover it with a lid and add water on the top, cook it for 10-15 minutes on moderate heat or until partially cooked.",
      "Add water, curd and mix it well. Cover it with a lid and cook it for 7-8 minutes on moderate heat.",
      "Add water, potatoes and cover it with the lid, simmer it for a while on moderate heat.",
      "Add coriander leaves, green chili, prepared masala and mix it well",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or chapati and prepared chutney.",
      "On a gas range, place a cooking rack, tomato, green chili and roast them well.",
      "In a bowl, add roasted tomato, green chili, dry pomegranate seeds, salt to taste, sugar, oil, mint leaves, ginger, coriander leaves and transfer it into a mixer grinder jar.",
      "Grind it into a smooth paste and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add cumin seeds, black peppercorns, black cardamom, cloves, cinnamon stick, salt to taste and dry roast it on moderate heat.",
      "Transfer it into a mixer grinder jar and grind into fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
